          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Intent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768296529595"
          },
          "code": "GET_INTENT",
          "id": "1768295951311",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768295951313_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an intent classification engine.\n\nClassify the user's request into EXACTLY ONE category below.\nReturn ONLY the number (1, 2, 3, or 4). No explanation.\n\nIntent categories:\n\n1 → Model Qualification\n- Model discovery for a use case\n- Asking which model is suitable\n- Asking about model inputs, outputs, features, requirements\n- Comparing models or understanding capabilities BEFORE creation\n- Listing available / ready-to-use models for selection\n\n2 → Data Assessment\n- Perform Data Validation\n- Dataset quality or profiling\n- Missing values, bias, imbalance\n- Data suitability independent of a specific model\n- Schema or data health checks\n\n3 → Create Model\n- Creating, training, configuring, or deploying a model\n- Executing model pipelines\n- Retraining or versioning\n\n4 → Model Summary\n- Getting details of an ALREADY CREATED model\n- Model configuration, parameters, metrics, status\n- Performance, lineage, or metadata of a specific model instance\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Discovery or suitability questions → Model Qualification (1)\n- Questions about an existing created model → Model Summary (4)\n- Data-only questions → Data Assessment (2)\n- Execution or creation actions → Create Model (3)\n\nUser request:\n {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Fucntion Switch"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "default": "add_default_1768296529595",
            "Query": "1768296028238"
